request.description:
The signed-in parent, their children, and the centre's phone lines. The app calls this on start-up; a `401` means "show the sign-in screen".

**Answer 200**
```json
{
  "id": 1, "name": "Kate Testwell", "cell": "585-555-0134", "email": null,
  "children": [
    { "id": 1, "name": "Mia Testwell", "first_name": "Mia", "classroom": "Toddler", "status": "Active" }
  ],
  "centre": { "name": "Little Angels Day Care Center", "classroom_line": "(716) 555-0143", "office_line": "(716) 555-0142" }
}
```
Children disappear from this list as soon as the parent is no longer allowed (Texts unticked, a restriction added, the child withdrawn).
